<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate rose one basis point to 3.10 percent.</p>
<p>				  December 11 fix     December 10 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.06 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.10 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.31 pct		3.31 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.41 pct		3.41 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
